# Nothing is built or installed here - the pack has no dependencies.
# These are only guards against local noise.
.DS_Store
*.log
build-output/

# The pack's working diary stays local. It is the chronological record of
# building the pack and names real projects, live hosts and a domain.
# `dev-notes/status.md` and `dev-notes/coverage.md` are the public summaries of
# it and ARE tracked - the test suite and the entry points read them, so a clone
# without them fails its own tests. tests/test-seams.sh holds both halves.
dev-notes/journal.md
